WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.500
Here, and There, Glasses Guy is Everywhere

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:46.830
Karin-chan… Please save…

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:54.030
Kirika-senpai!!!

00:01:56.780 --> 00:02:00.530
I can feel some enormous power on the move. And…

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:04.790
my ring's never reacted like this before.

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:08.670
Even more than that, I can feel my ring's power growing too.

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:12.340
For this much power to be flowing out…

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:15.100
it must have something to do with that strange ring.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:24.560
I wonder who proposed to Karin-chan?

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:28.100
Karin-sama is still 13 years old.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.600
She can't get married.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.860
I want you to hurry and make the cake!

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.700
Kazune-kun.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:50.120
You came!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.790
Of course I did.

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:56.300
Kirika-senpai was… Kirika-senpai was…

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.090
by glasses guy!

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.260
You… it can't be…

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:34.710
Sagitta Solis!

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:40.340
This is for Kirika-senpai!

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:42.720
God Thunder!

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:58.570
How long will you be able to resist?

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:02.320
I won't ever forgive you, proposing glasses guy!

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.530
Shut up!

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:06.330
I'm not "proposing glasses guy"!

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.580
I'm Karasuma Kirio!

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.410
Is it my imagination?

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:14.370
It seemed like he is trying to hide the fact that he is a different person.

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.800
It's almost as if my ring is leading me there.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:28.560
This is…

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.790
Kirio-chan…

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:57.210
Kirika-chan…

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:20.820
Kazune-kun!

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:25.860
Somehow… it seems like the ring has begun to erect a barrier…

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:29.620
because some strong power is approaching.

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:31.540
Kazusa!

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:32.660
Yes.

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.540
She turned back into a bird.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:37.210
Just what is she?

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:39.250
Kazusa…

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:41.340
find an opening in the barrier.

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:46.510
If you don't hurry, the barrier will close completely.

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:50.220
Kazusa!

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.150
One of you got away…

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:04.030
but now you two are birds trapped in a cage.

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:10.570
Kazune-kun!

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:11.370
Kar-

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:22.980
That's… If I remember correctly, Kazune-kun's…

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:36.390
No way!

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:45.070
What's going on?

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:50.320
Kazune-kun!

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.780
Kazune-kun!

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:55.660
Where are you?

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:07.010
What is this?

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:20.310
Karin!

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:21.730
Kazune-kun?

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:23.060
Karin.

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:24.400
Kazune-kun…

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:27.320
Thank goodness, you were safe.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:28.860
Somehow.

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:30.820
What about you, you okay?

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:34.280
I was really worried when I was alone…

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.820
but now that you're here, I'm fine.

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:41.620
Ahh… no… I mean…

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:46.000
two heads and better than one, right?

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.380
That's true.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:51.220
Anyway, let's look for the exit.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.930
So we don't get separated, hold on tight.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:16.740
At this rate…

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:20.910
I can't save them or be by their side to help.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:31.130
This is Karasuma-san's house right?

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:33.070
Know where the entrance is?

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:37.640
I'm no one suspicious.

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:09.500
There sure are a lot of rooms, eh?

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:11.840
Oh?

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:15.830
You were able to find the door into the barrier my ring created.

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:19.720
Somehow, that ring of yours has lots of power.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:22.120
How interesting.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:32.210
As a fellow ring bearer…

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:34.570
I welcome you.

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:38.160
Sorry to intrude.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:54.090
I… had been to an unknown place like this before.

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.220
Where was that?

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:58.840
Probably… in a dream.

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:00.850
So, it was just a dream?

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:04.430
Karasuma!

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:06.020
Labyrinth glasses guy!

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:07.100
Shut up!

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:09.100
It's not "labyrinth glasses guy"!

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:10.110
Huh?

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:12.940
I mean, it's Karasuma Kirio.

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:19.200
Sagitta Solis!

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:30.830
Kazune-kun.

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:33.920
God Thunder!

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:36.920
No way!

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:52.210
I wonder which is the right way?

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:08.040
It seems that your ring…

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:11.540
has powers equal to mine.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:14.840
Where are Kazune-kun and Hanazono-san?

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:17.170
There is only one way for you to leave.

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:21.470
Join my side.

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:22.720
And if you don't…

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:25.850
I'll humbly take that ring of yours.

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:29.760
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:33.300
I am God!

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:38.260
You moron.

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:38.260
It's a croquette!

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:48.330
Kazune-kun!

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:50.250
It's no good.

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:52.220
I can't even hold off the attacks.

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:54.590
Now that it's turned out this way…

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:56.710
the only thing we can do is hand over the ring to Karasuma.

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:58.800
Kazune-kun, what are you saying?

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:01.260
Right now, that's all we can do!

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:04.640
Karin, give your ring to Karasuma!

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:06.060
No way…

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:08.060
What will happen to Himeka-chan?

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:11.060
At this rate, even you'll be defeated!

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:14.980
Ka-zu-ne-kun…

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:16.690
Think about Himeka later!

00:12:16.690 --> 00:12:18.230
Now, give me the ring!

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:20.820
Karin?

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:23.910
You are… not Kazune-kun!

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:25.620
What're you saying?

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:28.490
You haven't been afraid of the bug that's flying around!

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:33.040
Ah! How s-scary!

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.460
More than that…

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:38.250
no matter what dangerous situation Kazune-kun's in…

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:41.260
he always thinks about Himeka-chan first!

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:46.470
Just a little more and I would have had the ring.

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:48.760
Who… are you?

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:52.770
Kazune-kun glasses guy!

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:53.600
Shut up!

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.560
I'm not "Kazune-kun glasses guy"!

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:57.440
I'm Karasuma Kirio!

00:12:58.360 --> 00:12:59.570
Hey, wait a second…

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:01.900
There's one over there

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:03.610
and one here…

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:04.530
Why?

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:07.280
Ah, this one's this little brother.

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:11.450
No wait… his twin sister is Kirika-senpai…

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:14.370
In other words, you had other twins, didn't you?

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:16.260
How clever you are!

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:27.720
Eh?! Criminal siblings.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:34.480
Where's Karin?

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:36.350
Who knows…

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:39.560
By now, she must've disappeared already.

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:42.570
Don't screw with me!

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:47.070
I refuse the offer of becoming your ally.

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:49.830
I wouldn't mind joining the student council though.

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:52.300
I wonder if you'll change your mind after you see this.

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:56.870
Hanazono-san!

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.460
Kazune-kun!

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:02.590
Soon their lives will both be over.

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:06.010
Karin!

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:07.630
Karin, where are you?!

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:10.890
Kazune-kun!

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:13.390
Time is running out.

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:18.730
I won't ever become your ally.

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:21.400
I'll defeat you!

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:35.830
You can't transform, can you?

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:40.130
A guy like you who can't even do that…

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.670
can only do one thing…

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:49.180
hand over the ring and save them.

00:14:53.930 --> 00:14:55.270
Kazune-kun!

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:59.310
Kazune-kun!

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:00.770
Hanazono-san!

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:04.150
Now, what will you do?

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:12.820
I got it. I'll give it to you.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:15.330
This's good.

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:29.380
There was no point in…

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:31.390
entrusting the ring to me, in the end.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:35.220
Don't give up.

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:37.520
Professor Kujyou?

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:42.440
Don't give up, Michiru!

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:51.090
Poor thing… he's only six years old.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:55.580
He lost is parents and is all alone…

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:58.830
Alone?

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:00.750
No…

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:02.960
Papa… Mama…

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:04.840
take me with you.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.510
Doctor Kujyou! There's trouble!

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:11.050
Michiru-kun's condition is getting worse!

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:15.890
Michiru-kun… don't give up!

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:17.560
You're not alone!

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:20.640
Don't give up on living!

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:22.690
Michiru-kun!

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:23.770
Michiru!

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:31.990
I'm… not… alone?

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:37.780
What's this?

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:41.370
An important ring.

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:45.830
It has Zeus's power to seal any amount of evil.

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:49.460
Zeus's power to seal evil?

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:51.590
I'm entrusting it to you.

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:54.260
Protect your family with it.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:57.800
Protect… my family?

00:16:58.470 --> 00:16:59.930
That's right, Michiru.

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:04.230
You, who didn't give up even on the brink of death…

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:07.480
have the ultimate power to protect your family.

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:10.480
Why are you giving this to me?

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:15.200
Because you too, Michiru, are a part of my important family.

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:17.740
Family…

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:24.960
It's no good to give up.

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.710
I remembered…

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:36.090
the memories…

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:38.140
that were sealed.

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:41.430
I have to protect my family… right?

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:46.690
The ring is…

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:51.070
Why are you hesitating?

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:12.800
Why you!..

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:15.760
W-What?..

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:41.200
The crows… and the dogs… are really restless.

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:48.790
Kazune-kun?

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:51.380
Karin! Are you alright?

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:53.050
Kazune-kun!

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:55.420
What?

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:57.430
Are you really Kazune-kun?

00:18:57.430 --> 00:18:58.260
Huh?

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:01.550
What are you doing?!

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:04.930
Ah! A bug!

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:06.270
He's the real thing!

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:07.850
I'm so glad!

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.150
What the heck? Seriously…

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:14.770
- I'm so glad you're okay!

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:14.770
- Micchi

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:18.450
Listen, listen… you know this ring…

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:21.700
it's not meant to make me transform…

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:23.780
but it has Zeus's power…

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:26.250
to seal all evil!

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:28.460
A ring with Zeus's power to seal evil?

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:31.630
Really? Amazing!

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:33.250
I know, I know!

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:34.670
Anyway, thank you.

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:36.590
Thanks, Micchi.

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:37.920
Then, Hanazono-san…

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:39.720
let's go on a date tomorrow.

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:42.220
What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:44.430
As a reward for defeating Karasuma.

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:46.100
Don't get cocky.

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:48.810
Then, will you go on a date with me, Kazune-kun?

00:19:48.810 --> 00:19:52.270
Why do I have to go on a date with you?

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:53.650
What's wrong with that?

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:55.110
There's lots wrong.

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:57.740
Eh? Kazune-kun, you're so stingy.

00:19:57.740 --> 00:20:00.910
In that case, let's triple date.

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:02.450
All three of us?

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:04.410
It's decided!

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:07.700
Where should we go tomorrow?

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:10.160
Micchi?

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.670
Nishikiyori?

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:13.920
A date with all three of us!

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:16.340
Where should we go?

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:28.850
- Nishikiyori! 
- Micchi!

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:34.400
Micchi…

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.070
No way…

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:39.990
No! No!

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:44.030
That such a powerful ring existed…

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:45.910
Karasuma, you jerk!

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:48.990
Give Micchi back!!!

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.250
It's been a while…

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:58.880
Kujyou Kazuto.

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:02.550
Who the heck are you?!

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:04.510
I'm happy.

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:06.390
Even though my life already ended…

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:09.310
I can meet up with you again.

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:10.640
Kazuto?..

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:12.480
Who's Kazuto?

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:14.520
It's my dad's name.

00:21:14.520 --> 00:21:15.810
Huh?

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:18.980
Look here, this person is Kujyou Kazune!

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:21.030
He's professor Kujyou's son…

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:22.530
Stupid glasses guy!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:27.740
I'm not "stupid glasses guy" or Karasuma Kirio.

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:32.830
My name is Karasuma Kirihiko.

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:36.170
Karasuma… Kirihiko?..

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:40.590
Yes. The one who worked with and was best friends with Kujyou Kazuto.

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:42.840
Isn't he glasses guy?

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:45.380
Why… why are you…

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:49.390
I was confident enough in my abilities to seal myself into this ring.

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:55.140
I was revived by the hatred and sadness that Kirio was feeling.

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:59.730
He sealed himself inside his own ring…

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:01.150
That's…

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:02.820
It's easy.

00:22:02.820 --> 00:22:04.150
First of all…

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:07.410
weren't you confident enough in your abilities to copy Kujyou Kazuto's body…

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:10.910
and make a clone that looks exactly like him?

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:15.750
Kazune-kun is a copy?

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:16.750
Now then…

00:22:16.750 --> 00:22:19.330
it's time we stopped playing around.

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:24.210
I'll give you a special show of the powers of Zeus in this ring.

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Saa, ikou yo shiranai michi

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Come, let's go down an unknown path.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
Sugu kieru mayotetteta

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
It will soon dissappear, and we'll be lost.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Hamikaze  sasotte

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Invited by the humming wind…

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
Sasayaku kuchi no hou ikutte uta

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
…that whispered out of my singing mouth.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
Sagashiteta mirai soba ni aru

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
The future you're looking for is right next to you.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Messeeji wa hitotsu kasanaru yo

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
The messages are all piling up, one by one.

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
Sora e kabatte tobashite yume o kabatte sakebu yo

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
I'm going to fly up, protected into the sky and shout my dreams out to the world.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
Kimi ni todoke nanairo no michi tokuchuu meeru

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
So that it'll reach you, my special delivery mail along a rainbow-coloured road.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
Hakanai negai demo isshunkai hanatto yo

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
I won't abandon my fleeting wish, even for a second.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
Kimi ni todoke kono omoi to kimi ni fuiteta kaze wo

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
So that my feelings will reach you, through this blowing wind.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:10.370
The Labyrinth of Zeus's Ring

00:24:06.190 --> 00:24:08.400
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:11.200
The labyrinth of Zeus's ring.

00:24:11.200 --> 00:24:13.370
A different glasses guy has appeared.

00:24:13.370 --> 00:24:16.080
And many secrets have been revealed.

00:24:16.080 --> 00:24:19.540
Kazune-kun… is all of this the truth?
